Package: mapSpainHist
Type: Package
Title: Historical Municipal Boundaries of Spain (1900-2001)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pau", "Vall Prat", , "pau.vall@ub.edu", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1418-7833"))
Description: Municipal boundaries of Spain for each population census between
    1900 and 2001, together with provinces, judicial districts and electoral
    districts (Cortes of the Restoration in 1920 and constituencies of the
    Second Republic in 1931, 1933 and 1936) built from them, and the census
    figures of every municipality from 1842 to 2011. All maps derive from a
    single partition of the territory, so they have no gaps or overlaps and
    can be aggregated consistently. Boundaries of historical municipalities
    are an approximate reconstruction. Geometries are downloaded from 'Zenodo'
    and cached locally.
